# Secrets read from the environment at deploy time (pulumi up) and injected as
# Lambda env vars. Copy to .env and fill in, or export in your shell / CI.

# Login credentials AND per-user gym config now live in packages/config/users.json
# — not here. Default user: billy.

# --- lifting (Lift Coach) ---
# Global Hevy *Pro API* key — the per-user FALLBACK. The primary path is the
# consumer "user API": a per-user refresh token seeded in packages/config/
# users.json (config.hevy), with rotated tokens persisted in the lifting DynamoDB
# table. With neither a user token nor this key, the app serves mock data.
HEVY_API_KEY=
# Optional: enables the Claude-powered coaching card. Without it, a rule-based
# summary is shown instead.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional model override for the coaching card (defaults to claude-opus-4-8).
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=
